    <p><em>*UAE does not offer citizenship through residency, but the 10-year Golden Visa provides long-term stability.</em></p>

    <h3>Why a Second Passport Matters</h3>
    <p>A second passport is not a luxury — it is <strong>insurance</strong>. It provides visa-free travel, banking access in multiple jurisdictions, and a legal fallback if your home country's tax regime becomes hostile. For US citizens, it also opens the door to a future renunciation strategy (consult a specialist before considering this).</p>

    <div class="book-callout blue">
        <div class="callout-title">ARCHITECT'S NOTE</div>
        <p>Portugal remains the fastest path to an EU passport for non-EU citizens. An EU passport grants you the right to live and work in <strong>27 countries</strong> — the ultimate geographic optionality.</p>
    </div>
</div>

